exploded views with CSS grid + 3D transforms 🤙

[data-explode=true] .layer { translate: 0 0 2rem; }
.layer:hover .shadow { opacity: 1 }
.shadow:has(+ .layer:hover) { opacity: 0.2; }

leverage the cascade 🤌

dynamic toggle with CSS :has() 🎁

.control:not(:has(:first-of-type:checked)) .indicator {
  translate: 100% 0;
}

leverage [type=radio]:checked with :has() to set the visuals 🤙

