We built Obsidian, but for your app.

No mobile dev holds a perfect spatial model of their own app. It's too big to keep in one head. So we store it somewhere else.

Watch me reconstruct a real user flow, pulled straight from the app's spatial graph -&gt;

Recent Design — X/Twitter 上的每日设计精选聚合站
X 上其实有大量优质设计作品在流通，但它们淹没在算法、口水仗和推广内容里，普通人根本刷不到。 这个站做的事就是人工筛选——把散落在各处的好设计集中到一个极简的画廊页面里，每天更新。
🔗：&lt;https://recent.design/&gt;
